(PUBLIC WORKS DEPARTMENT — Tender CE/CIV/54/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers hostel block construction — civil and internal electrical works) Tj T*
(complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(1. The structure shall be designed for the exposure condition severe as defined in IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(1. All plain and reinforced concrete work shall conform to IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(2. All RCC work shall be of grade M30.) Tj T*
(3. Nominal cover to reinforcement shall be 45mm.) Tj T*
(4. The free water-cement ratio shall not exceed 0.45.) Tj T*
(5. Minimum cement content shall be 320 kg/m³.) Tj T*
(6. Cement shall be ordinary Portland cement 43 grade conforming to IS 269:2015.) Tj T*
(7. Coarse and fine aggregates shall conform to IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(8. Reinforcement shall be Fe 500D TMT bars conforming to IS 1786:2008.) Tj T*
(9. Concrete shall be design mix proportioned as per IS 10262:2019. Distribution boards and) Tj T*
(enclosures shall be of suitable size.) Tj T*
(10. Curing shall be continued for a minimum period of 10 days.) Tj T*
(11. Concrete shall be compacted with mechanical needle vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(1. Wiring shall be carried out as per IS 732:1989.) Tj T*
(2. The supply system shall be TN-S earthing arrangement.) Tj T*
(3. Wiring shall be concealed in rigid PVC conduits of 1.5mm wall thickness.) Tj T*
(4. Wires shall be FR PVC insulated, single core, stranded copper conductor of 450/750 V grade) Tj T*
(conforming to IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(5. Lighting circuits shall be wired with 1.5 sq mm and power circuits with 4 sq mm copper) Tj T*
(conductors.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
